**Calibration anchors consulted:**
- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews_2026/nDrZow7fCF.md` (UniRestorer, avg score 6.00, Accept Poster): Topically similar universal restoration. Stronger experimental fairness and routing clarity than PRISM; PRISM’s baseline comparison asymmetry places it below this anchor.
- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews_2026/CzVlgDOF7L.md` (DATPRL-IR, avg score 4.50, Accept Poster): Multi-domain all-in-one restoration with prompt learning. Shares unverified zero-shot claims and insufficient prompt-mechanism detail. PRISM has stronger downstream evaluation but similar methodological documentation gaps.
